Behaviour changes of the public equipment copies, relative to their originals with the comment-only hygiene
applied (earlier lab identifiers removed from comments and docstrings of qb1.sh, procwatch.py and mkbundle.sh).
That hygiene is not reproduced here; OVERLAY-MANIFEST.json gives each original's and each copy's sha256.
qb1.sh: lsof by the actual uid; b1s localfn runs its helper with the server's observed package environment;
localfn's yaml containment also counts a macOS app prefix's same-path Contents/Resources twin (PyInstaller).
procwatch.py: PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX is recorded in plain. mkbundle.sh and capture.py have no behaviour change.

